    Expanding (a + b)^2: a^2 + 2ab + b^2
    
    Expanding (a - b)^2: a^2 - 2ab + b^2
    
    Subtracting them: (a^2 + 2ab + b^2) - (a^2 - 2ab + b^2) = 4ab. 
    
    So, indeed, (a + b)^2 - (a - b)^2 = 4ab. 
    
